        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sea-Envy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/48/1849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sea-Envy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/violentsilence\">@ViolentSilence</a> i shared the link before i started watching and was not a big fan of all the FX either…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I couldn’t watch very much of it. Too many and constant distractions… :-\\</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sea-Envy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/48/1849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sea-Envy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rabit\">@Rabit</a> i told you on Youtube that I knew Rabit <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And I definitely recognized Sea-Envy! (In a good way. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
